   "slug": "home",
   "title": "Gentle dentistry for the whole family",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"treatments\",\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div id=\"treatments\" class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\",\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center kicker\">Treatments</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center section-title\">Everything your smile needs, under one roof</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">From a child's first check-up to a full smile makeover, our team takes care of the whole family.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon\">✓</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Check-ups &amp; cleaning</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A gentle exam, a polish and an honest chat about your teeth, every six months.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:everyday-care}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon treat-icon--coral\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon treat-icon--coral\">★</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Whitening</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>In-clinic or take-home whitening that brightens safely, without the sensitivity.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:cosmetic}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon treat-icon--sunny\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon treat-icon--sunny\">◡</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clear aligners</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Straighter teeth with nearly invisible trays and check-ins every eight weeks.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:orthodontics}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon\">♥</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Kids' dentistry</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Happy first visits, sealants and lots of high fives. Children under 5 see us free.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:kids}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon treat-icon--coral\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon treat-icon--coral\">+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Implants &amp; crowns</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Natural-looking replacements for missing or broken teeth, planned in 3D.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:cosmetic}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon treat-icon--sunny\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon treat-icon--sunny\">!</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Emergencies</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Toothache or a chipped tooth? We keep same-day slots open every morning.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:everyday-care}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-foam\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-foam\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"36%\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:36%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">Real results</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Before &amp; after</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Six months of clear aligners and one whitening session. Our patient said it was the first time in years she smiled in photos.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:treatments}}\">See treatments</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"64%\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:64%\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"before-after\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column before-after\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:before}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:before}}\" alt=\"Teeth before treatment\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:before}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Before</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"before-after\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column before-after\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:after}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:after}}\" alt=\"Teeth after treatment\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:after}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">After</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\",\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center kicker\">Meet the team</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center section-title\">Friendly faces, gentle hands</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"team-member\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column team-member\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:team-1}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-1}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Dr. Aria Holloway\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:team-1}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dr. Aria Holloway</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"team-role\"} --><p class=\"team-role\">Lead dentist</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fifteen years of family dentistry and a famously steady hand.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"team-member\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column team-member\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:team-2}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-2}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Dr. Kenji Marlowe\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:team-2}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dr. Kenji Marlowe</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"team-role\"} --><p class=\"team-role\">Orthodontist</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Plans every aligner case in 3D and explains it with a model.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"team-member\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column team-member\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:team-3}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-3}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Sofia Ruiz-Ellery\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:team-3}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sofia Ruiz-Ellery</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"team-role\"} --><p class=\"team-role\">Dental hygienist</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Makes cleanings relaxing, and remembers every patient's dog's name.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-foam\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-foam\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\",\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center kicker\">Happy patients</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center section-title\">What families say</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"review\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group review\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"stars\"} --><p class=\"stars\">★★★★★</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>My son used to cry at the dentist. Now he asks when we're going back to see Sofia.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"reviewer\"} --><p class=\"reviewer\">Parent of a 6-year-old</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"review\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group review\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"stars\"} --><p class=\"stars\">★★★★★</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The aligners were easier than I expected and Dr. Marlowe explained every step.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"reviewer\"} --><p class=\"reviewer\">Aligner patient</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"review\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group review\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"stars\"} --><p class=\"stars\">★★★★★</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Called at 8 with a cracked tooth, was fixed by 11. Lovely, calm team.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"reviewer\"} --><p class=\"reviewer\">Emergency patient</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\",\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center kicker\">Smile tips</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center section-title\">Oral-care articles</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":3,\"displayPostDate\":true,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"columns\":3,\"displayPostContent\":true,\"excerptLength\":22} /--></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
