   "excerpt": "Prices, options and real results.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">All our treatments start with a conversation. We explain what we see, what we recommend and what it costs, and you decide.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon\">✓</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Check-ups &amp; cleaning</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A gentle exam, a polish and an honest chat about your teeth, every six months.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:everyday-care}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon treat-icon--coral\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon treat-icon--coral\">★</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Whitening</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>In-clinic or take-home whitening that brightens safely, without the sensitivity.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:cosmetic}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon treat-icon--sunny\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon treat-icon--sunny\">◡</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clear aligners</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Straighter teeth with nearly invisible trays and check-ins every eight weeks.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:orthodontics}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon\">♥</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Kids' dentistry</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Happy first visits, sealants and lots of high fives. Children under 5 see us free.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:kids}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon treat-icon--coral\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon treat-icon--coral\">+</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Implants &amp; crowns</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Natural-looking replacements for missing or broken teeth, planned in 3D.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:cosmetic}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"treat-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group treat-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"treat-icon treat-icon--sunny\"} --><p class=\"treat-icon treat-icon--sunny\">!</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Emergencies</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Toothache or a chipped tooth? We keep same-day slots open every morning.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:everyday-care}}\">Learn more &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Prices at a glance</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"className\":\"is-style-left\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-table is-style-left\"><table><thead><tr><th>Treatment</th><th>From</th><th>Good to know</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Check-up and cleaning</td><td>$85</td><td>Covered by most insurance plans</td></tr><tr><td>Children's check-up</td><td>Free under 5</td><td>$45 for ages 5–12</td></tr><tr><td>Whitening (take-home)</td><td>$290</td><td>Custom trays included</td></tr><tr><td>Clear aligners</td><td>$2,900</td><td>Payment plans from $120/month</td></tr><tr><td>Emergency visit</td><td>$95</td><td>Same-day slots every morning</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"before-after\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column before-after\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:before}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:before}}\" alt=\"Teeth before treatment\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:before}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Before</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"before-after\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column before-after\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\"