  {
   "slug": "team",
   "title": "Meet the team",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Seven people, one goal: that you leave with a healthier smile than you arrived with, and without any fear of coming back.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"team-member\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column team-member\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:team-1}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-1}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Dr. Aria Holloway\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:team-1}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dr. Aria Holloway</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"team-role\"} --><p class=\"team-role\">Lead dentist</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Fifteen years of family dentistry and a famously steady hand.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"team-member\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column team-member\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:team-2}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-2}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Dr. Kenji Marlowe\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:team-2}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dr. Kenji Marlowe</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"team-role\"} --><p class=\"team-role\">Orthodontist</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Plans every aligner case in 3D and explains it with a model.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"team-member\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column team-member\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:team-3}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:team-3}}\" alt=\"Illustrated portrait of Sofia Ruiz-Ellery\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:team-3}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sofia Ruiz-Ellery</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"team-role\"} --><p class=\"team-role\">Dental hygienist</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Makes cleanings relaxing, and remembers every patient's dog's name.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our promise</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"fun-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list fun-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>We never rush a nervous patient.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>We always explain before we start.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>We give you a written estimate before any treatment.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>We say so when something can wait.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->",
   "template": "page-wide",
   "menu_order": 2
  },
  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About the clinic",
   "content": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:clinic}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:clinic}}\" alt=\"The bright treatment room\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:clinic}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Our treatment rooms have ceiling screens, so you can watch something calm while we work.</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bright Smile opened in 2014 with one chair and a simple idea: a dental visit should feel like visiting friends who happen to be very good at teeth.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Today we have four treatment rooms, a kids' corner with books and a fish tank, and a team of seven who genuinely love what they do.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why families choose us</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"fun-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list fun-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Evening and Saturday appointments</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Gentle, explained treatment for nervous patients</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Free check-ups for children under five</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Same-day emergency slots</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->",
   "menu_order": 3
  },
  {
   "slug": "book",
   "title": "Book a visit",
   "excerpt": "New patients always welcome.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">New patients are always welcome. Call us, or send a message with a few times that suit you and we will confirm the same day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Call or visit</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"tel:+15550173300\">+1 (555) 017-3300</a><br>27 Seaside Parade, Brightwater</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Mon–Fri 8:00–19:00<br>Sat 9:00–14:00</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your first visit</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"fun-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list fun-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Arrive ten minutes early to fill in a short health form</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Bring any previous X-rays and your insurance card</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Kids can bring a favourite toy for the chair</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tip-bubble\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tip-bubble\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Toothache right now?</strong> Call before 10 am and we will see you today.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "menu_order": 4
  }
